        "name": "Pop Blossom",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "After a short preparation, Neeko leaps into the air, knocking up all nearby enemies. Upon landing, nearby enemies are damaged and stunned. The preparation is hidden if Neeko is disguised.",
        "bodyHtml": "After a delay Neeko leaps into the air, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Up</span> all nearby enemies for 0.6 seconds. She then crashes down, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/350/550 + (120% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to all nearby enemies and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> them for 0.75 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability can be prepared in secret if Neeko is disguised. 0.5 seconds after casting this ability Neeko breaks her disguise.</span>",
